          "title": "Imperial Settlers",
          "subtitle": "Card Game",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Imperial Settlers is a commercial card-driven city-building strategy game where players build faction tableaus, collect resources, and score points."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Published by Portal Games in 2014 and designed by Maciej Obszański and Ignacy Trzewiczek, Imperial Settlers won several card-game and strategy-game awards."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Setup",
