          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "1-4 players use the table arrangement described for Imperial Settlers."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Commercial faction and common card decks with resource components"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Commercial faction and common card decks with resource components, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Prepare Commercial faction and common card decks with resource components and deal or lay out cards according to the documented Imperial Settlers rules before play begins."
